graph TD
    Start([Index Keeper marks topic dirty]) --> Fetch[Fetch Topic from DB]
    Fetch --> FetchFacts[Fetch ALL RawFacts<br/>grouped by angle]
    Fetch --> FetchCode[Fetch ALL CodeBlocks]
    Fetch --> FetchTables[Fetch ALL ComparisonTables]

    FetchFacts --> Build[Build structured payload]
    FetchCode --> Build
    FetchTables --> Build

    Build --> CheckRewrite{Is rewrite?}
    CheckRewrite -->|Yes| AddFeedback[Append reviewer feedback]
    CheckRewrite -->|No| CallLLM
    AddFeedback --> CallLLM[Call LLM note_author]

    CallLLM --> Strip[Strip markdown fences]
    Strip --> Review[Reviewer Agent]

    Review --> ReviewLLM[Call LLM reviewer]
    ReviewLLM --> CheckApproved{Approved?}

    CheckApproved -->|Yes| Diagram[Diagram Agent]
    CheckApproved -->|No| CheckRetry{retry_count < 3?}

    CheckRetry -->|Yes| Increment[Increment retry_count]
    CheckRetry -->|No| AppendComment[Append feedback as HTML comment]

    Increment --> StoreFeedback[Store reviewer_feedback]
    StoreFeedback --> Rewrite[Set needs_rewrite=true]
    Rewrite --> CallLLM

    AppendComment --> Diagram

    Diagram --> Detect[Detect signals<br/>Regex-based]
    Detect --> CheckSignals{Signals detected?}

    CheckSignals -->|No| Format[Formatter Agent]
    CheckSignals -->|Yes| Limit[Limited to MAX_DIAGRAMS]

    Limit --> LoopDiagrams[For each signal]
    LoopDiagrams --> Generate[Call LLM diagram_agent]
    Generate --> Extract[Extract Mermaid code]
    Extract --> LoopDiagrams

    LoopDiagrams --> Format

    Format --> Insert[Insert diagrams<br/>at contextually<br/>appropriate positions]
    Insert --> CheckExisting{Existing Note?}

    CheckExisting -->|Yes| SaveVersion[Save as NoteVersion]
    CheckExisting -->|No| CreateNote[Create new Note]

    SaveVersion --> UpdateNote[Update Note<br/>increment version]
    CreateNote --> ClearDirty[Clear topic.is_dirty]
    UpdateNote --> ClearDirty

    ClearDirty --> AddCompleted[Add to completed_topic_ids]
    AddCompleted --> NextTopic[Next Topic Agent]

    NextTopic --> IncrementIdx[Increment current_topic_idx]
    IncrementIdx --> ResetState[Reset per-topic state]
    ResetState --> CheckMore{More topics?}

    CheckMore -->|Yes| LoopBack[Loop back to author_note]
    CheckMore -->|No| End([END])

    style Start fill:#ff9999
    style End fill:#99ff99
    style CallLLM fill:#ffe1f5
    style ReviewLLM fill:#ffe1f5
    style Generate fill:#ffe1f5
    style Format fill:#e1f5ff
    style NextTopic fill:#e1f5ff
